kly grab images and videos from status updates.\r\n\u2605 Easily download status photos and videos with the status saver app.\r\nStatus Saver, Status Downloader and Easy Save Status Videos\r\n\r\nQR Scanner:\r\nQR Scanner and barcode reader and scanner is the Quickest QR code scanner available in the QR & Barcode Scanner app. Every Android device needs a QR reader,Qr Scanner, and a QR & Barcode Scanner is a necessity. With its built-in rapid QR Reader feature of QR Scanner, the QR & Barcode Scanner and QR code reader are incredibly user-friendly. Just Scan QR code with a barcode reader and scanner, and the Qr scanner will begin scanning immediately. No need to take pictures, change the zoom, or click any buttons, the barcode reader and scanner with QR Code Reader operate automatically.\r\n\r\nDirect Chat:\r\nStatus Saver & QR scanner Pro has another most important feature of direct chat. Without saving contact we can send the messages.\r\n\r\nSo now, you have this App with a Direct Chat option also. This option is also very simple and easy to use. There are simple and easy three steps.\r\n\r\n1) Open this app and then open the Direct Chat option\r\n2) Select country code, enter number and text message.\r\n3) click on the send button and the message is sent\r\n\r\n<b>\u2728 Features of QR Code Reader and Barcode Scanner</b>\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Comprehensive support of QR Reader and barcode Scanner.\r\n\u2b50 Scan QR codes directly from your image gallery in a barcode reader and scanner.\r\n\u2b50 Multipurpose QR scanner for barcodes and decoding.\r\n\u2b50 Instantly Decode With Qr Reader.\r\n\u2b50 Connect to WiFi networks using a WiFi QR code Scanner.\r\n\u2b50 Enjoy a seamless experience with a user-friendly interface.\r\n\r\nWe are always trying to develop helpful apps and your good reviews always help to improve this Status Saver & QR Scanner Pro App. Help us by sharing this with your friends and family members, this app is very helpful for you.",
